A Day in My DevOps Life
Every day brings a new challenge — and that’s what makes DevOps so exciting!
🕘 9 AM: Checked Grafana dashboards to ensure all services are healthy
 🛠️ 11 AM: Debugged a broken CI pipeline (yes, it failed again 😅)
 ☁️ 1 PM: Updated Helm charts for a newly onboarded microservice
 📦 3 PM: Pushed Docker images to our private registry
 🧹 5 PM: Cleaned up unused volumes... and grabbed a well-earned coffee ☕
It’s more than just writing scripts or managing servers — it’s about keeping systems alive, efficient, and scalable.
